    "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:41:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-30T08:41:59Z",
    "body": "Servo also ran into this. Currently it runs:\n\n1. When the [href](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#attr-link-href) attribute of the [link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element) element of an [external resource link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#external-resource-link) that is already [browsing-context connected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#browsing-context-connected) is changed.\n2. When the [sizes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#attr-link-sizes) attribute of the [link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element) element of an [external resource link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#external-resource-link) that is already [browsing-context connected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#browsing-context-connected) is changed.\n3. When the [external resource link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#external-resource-link)'s [link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element) element [becomes browsing-context connected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#becomes-browsing-context-connected).\n4. When the [external resource link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#external-resource-link) is created on a [link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element) element that is already [browsing-context connected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#browsing-context-connected).\n\nCan we add those similar to the other link types?",
